Wine Execution Issues: Run winecfg to verify Windows version is set to Windows 10.

Missing API Functions: Verify that all required Windows API libraries are properly linked during compilation.

Conclusion
You have successfully created and executed C programs that enumerate processes and threads using Windows API calls on a Linux system. This lab demonstrated how to use CreateToolhelp32Snapshot, Process32First/Next, and Thread32First/Next functions to gather system information. These skills are essential for system monitoring, security analysis, and process management applications. The techniques learned here form the foundation for more advanced system programming and malware analysis tasks.
